  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759765,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1500 DS Spirits Vol. 3: Block Kuzushi - Nintendo DS Description\n\nStep into a retro arcade experience with *1500 DS Spirits Vol. 3: Block Kuzushi* for the Nintendo DS! This addictive Action game draws inspiration from the timeless classic Breakout, offering a fresh and engaging twist on a beloved formula. Developed and published by Tasuke, originally released in Japan in 2007, *Block Kuzushi* challenges players to skillfully maneuver a paddle and bounce balls to shatter intricate arrangements of blocks.\n\nThe gameplay is simple to pick up, yet surprisingly deep. Each stage presents a unique and increasingly complex layout of blocks, demanding precision and strategic thinking to clear. Can you master the physics and overcome the escalating difficulty to conquer every stage? \n\nExperience the charm of classic arcade gameplay with a modern Nintendo DS touch. *Block Kuzushi* is a perfect blend of nostalgia and accessible fun, providing hours of captivating block-breaking action. Prepare to test your reflexes and puzzle-solving skills in this delightful and challenging game!"
    },
